# Gun game with blockable map spawners (gungame.mapVehicles), vehicle
# levels using the map's vehicle spawn points (gungame.spotRange), and the
# respawn time (gungame.respawnTime) restored when gun game stops.
# Ladder: tests/gungame/gg_sim.cfg (level 2 is the T34).
gungame.enabled 1
gungame.lockWeapons 0
gungame.mapVehicles 0
gungame.respawnTime 0
gungame.spotRange 1000
rmm caps
rmm events
.template Rus_AT
.template German_Assault
.template T34 vehicle
.template Willys vehicle
.join Alice 1
.join Bob 2
.map gg_sim
.wait 0.5
# the map's spawners: all blocked; their spots are remembered
.spawner T34 400 14 400 2 90
.spawner Boat 100 30 100 1
# level 2 (T34): it goes to the T34 spawn point, not next to Alice
.spawn 0
gg set #0 2
.wait 0.5
.players
# map vehicles allowed again: the spawners spawn
gungame.mapVehicles 1
.spawners
# ...and not: the empty ones go (Alice's T34 stays)
gungame.mapVehicles 0
.wait 0.5
.players
# gun game off: the server's spawn timing is back
gungame.enabled 0
.wait 1.5
